.TH GENEEXPRESSION 1 2000-1月 "write.decomposition" "write.decomposition"
.SH NAME
write.decomposition \- Write the per-strain expression matrices of the community decomposition result to CSV files.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIwrite.decomposition(\fBresult\fR as list, 
\fBdir\fR as string, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Write the per-strain expression matrices of the community decomposition result to CSV files.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBresult\fB \fR\- The decomposition result that generated by the \fBdecompose_community\fR api.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBdir\fB \fR\- The output directory, it will be created automatically when it is not exists.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- The R# runtime environment.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
A character vector of the file path of the exported matrix files. besides the
 per-strain matrix files, an \fBabundance.csv\fR and a \fBsummary.csv\fR table will
 also be generated in the same directory.
.PP
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
```r
 let files = geneExpression::write.decomposition(result, "/path/to/decomposed");
 ```
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
geneExpression
.SH FILES
.PP
phenotype_kit.dll
.PP
